d 4 on pages 2-6 of th\u00e9 Stimulus Booklet then answer", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.36596736596736595, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.3791763791763792}, {"text": "the questions below.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.38306138306138304, "x1": 0.2835164835164835, "y1": 0.3954933954933955}, {"text": "Text 1 \u2014 Short story extract", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.43278943278943277, "x1": 0.36813186813186816, "y1": 0.445998445998446}, {"text": "(a) In what ways is dialogue used to capture the young couple\u2019s reactions to the 2", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4662004662004662, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.4794094794094794}, {"text": "items they find?", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.4825174825174825, "x1": 0.2967032967032967, "y1": 0.49572649572649574}, {"text": "Text 2 \u2014 Image", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5322455322455323, "x1": 0.25824175824175827, "y1": 0.5454545454545454}, {"text": "(b) How does the image individual wKo values discovered objects? 2", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5656565656565656, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.5788655788655789}, {"text": "Text 3 \u2014 Poem,", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6161616161616161, "x1": 0.25274725274725274, "y1": 0.6262626262626263}, {"text": "(c) Explain\u2019 how the p\u00e9\u00e9m conveys th\u00e9 personal response of the father to his 3", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.6495726495726496, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.6627816627816627}, {"text": "discoveries.", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.6666666666666666, "x1": 0.26043956043956046, "y1": 0.675990675990676}, {"text": "Text/4 \u2014 Nonfiction extract", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.7156177156177156, "x1": 0.36153846153846153, "y1": 0.7257187257187258}, {"text": "(d) Analyse how the text portrays the difficulties of discovering \u2018what is true and 3", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.749028749028749, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.7622377622377622}, {"text": "what is false\u2019", "x0": 0.16813186813186815, "y0": 0.7661227661227661, "x1": 0.2725274725274725, "y1": 0.7762237762237763}, {"text": "Text 1, Text 2, Text 3 and Text 4 \u2014 Short story extract, Image, Poem and", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.8158508158508159, "x1": 0.7505494505494505, "y1": 0.8290598290598291}, {"text": "Nonfiction extract", "x0": 0.4318681318681319, "y0": 0.8321678321678322, "x1": 0.5868131868131868, "y1": 0.8422688422688422}, {"text": "(e) Compare TWO of the texts represent the significance of curiosity in the 5", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.8624708624708625, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.8826728826728827}, {"text": "discovering.", "x0": 0.2549450549450549, "y0": 0.8834498834498834, "x1": 0.35274725274725277, "y1": 0.8958818958818959}], [{"text": "Section II", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08236208236208237, "x1": 0.2164835164835165, "y1": 0.09401709401709402}, {"text": "15 marks", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.11810411810411811, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "Attempt Question 2", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.13364413364413363, "x1": 0.2879120879120879, "y1": 0.14685314685314685}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.14996114996114995, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.16006216006216006}, {"text": "Answer the question on pages 8-15 of the Paper 1 Writing Booklet. Extra writing booklets are", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.18337218337218336, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.19658119658119658}, {"text": "available.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.20124320124320125, "x1": 0.1956043956043956, "y1": 0.21056721056721056}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.23154623154623155, "x1": 0.5274725274725275, "y1": 0.24397824397824397}, {"text": "\u2122 express understanding of discovery in the context of your studies", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2501942501942502, "x1": 0.694505494505